Bug 2062008 - Persist selected calendar event categories

Save applies the current category selection to the event copy. Failed Save retains the draft for retry. Cancel, close, duplicate requests, and late results preserve the correct event and session.

TB-Tools-Id: 49012a4d-f84d-4875-9a4c-873dec74d2c2


